    <h3 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 1.4;">Documentation, Labeling &amp; Booking</h3>
    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">Keep the registration certificate, insurance, and a printed copy of the IRCTC bike parcel booking or the bike parcel service in Thanjavur receipt handy. Label the motorcycle with the owner’s name, contact number, and “Fragile – Handle with Care.” Clear labeling assists the loading crew of bus bike transport and railway handlers, ensuring the parcel reaches its destination intact.</p>
  </div>
</div>

<p>By following this checklist, you guarantee that every bike parcel—whether moving through a bus, a railway carriage, or a dedicated two‑wheeler transport service in Gandhinagar—arrives on time, in the same condition as it left, and with all regulatory requirements satisfied.</p></div>
