    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">Upon arrival at the destination, the delivery personnel should conduct a thorough re-inspection of the motorcycle in daylight conditions. This is essential to identify any potential damages or discrepancies that might have occurred during transit. The inspection should include:</p>
