    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">Next, the odometer reading of the motorcycle must be verified against the details mentioned in the LR bilty (loading receipt). This step is critical to ensure that the vehicle has not been used or tampered with during transit. The following should be confirmed:</p>
<ul style="list-style: none; padding-left: 0; margin-top: 14px; margin-bottom: 0; border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); padding-top: 10px;">
  <li style="color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 0.84rem; line-height: 1.5; margin-bottom: 6px; display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 8px;">
